(footprint "ElectroCookie_Breadboard_Full" (version 20241229) (generator "pcbnew") (generator_version "9.0") (layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "ElectroCookie full-size solderable breadboard PCB (172.7 x 52.1 mm). 2 x 5 x 63 strip holes at 2.54 mm, strip rows 7.62 mm across the centre gap, two power rails per side, M3 centre holes at 0 and +/-78.74, M2 corner holes at (+/-81.28, +/-17.78). Each 5-hole strip is one pad number: L<row> for holes A-E, R<row> for F-J; rail pads share the names T-/T+/B+/B-. Back-side copper reproduces the strip and rail traces; the two-pad solder jumpers at each end join the outer (-) rails (left end) and inner (+) rails (right end). Outline and holes from the ElectroCookie dimension drawing; rail length and jumper positions from photos.")
	(tags "electrocookie breadboard protoboard")
